[08:45] e3fb62ebfa4f36acf5cbff6a6ed0f2e0: oh sorry, with &quot;you&quot; above I meant the WG
[08:45] a9b326df4e6da61c5b6f5e1058be83a2: yeah
[08:47] a9b326df4e6da61c5b6f5e1058be83a2: anyway, I'm playing catch-up on it at this point. The MWI and the WG would like to get it ready for publication in time to announce it at the Mobile Internet World event that starts in Boston on November 13
