conv_id=396 | raw="
CONVERSATION:
[00:58] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: TabAtkins: qq...flex-align: stretch on parent, flex-item-align: auto on child. getcomputedstyle of flex-item-align on the child should return stretch or auto?
[00:58] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: TabAtkins: and what spec covers this?
[00:59] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: computed style continue to confound me
[00:59] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: i guess this is covered by cssom
[01:02] 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: http://dev.w3.org/csswg/cssom/#resolved-values
[01:02] 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: since flex-align-item isn't in the magic list for getComputedStyle, it returns the computed value of that property
[01:04] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: yeah...i've read that before...but i don't see anything defining what &quot;resolved value&quot; and &quot;computed value&quot; actually are
[01:04] 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: resolved value = computed value, except for that list of properties in which case resolved value = something else
[01:04] 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: computed value = this guy: http://dev.w3.org/csswg/css3-cascade/#computed
[01:05] 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: so basically after matching selectors and doing inheritance
[01:06] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320++
[01:06] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: thx
[01:06] 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: i think it'd be auto in your case unless there's something that modifies it in some way due to inheritance
[01:07] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: yeah...it won't be auto. flex-align modifies it due to inheritance
[01:08] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: as in...if flex-item-align is auto, then it uses the flex-align value of it's parent
[01:09] 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: ah ok, i think that modification should apply to the computed value, then
[01:22] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: so it's not auto, but it's not the computed value either
[01:22] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: 353fa4cc248867e98de9cab7d122c320: so it's not auto, but it's not the computed value either
")
