[09:44] 451701585f2d2833921a7b3bd274aafa: It will not cause the worker to load the wrong document.
[10:01] 2da76487dd675c9c57c9c8a791f69791: hi, can anybody help me with a line height issue? &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:36pt;&quot;&gt;abc&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt; some long text &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; results in a paragraph with a line height of 36pt even in the lines which should only have 10pt. this happens in xhtml 5 as well as html 5. html 4 transitional works fine.
[10:04] 451701585f2d2833921a7b3bd274aafa: I might be able to, although not on this channel.
[10:06] 2da76487dd675c9c57c9c8a791f69791: 451701585f2d2833921a7b3bd274aafa: what other channel?
[10:07] 451701585f2d2833921a7b3bd274aafa: What do you mean by &quot;in html 5&quot;?
[10:08] 2da76487dd675c9c57c9c8a791f69791: when I set the doctype to &lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd&quot;&gt; it looks fine and when I set it to &lt;!DOCTYPE HTML&gt; I have this problem.
[10:09] 2da76487dd675c9c57c9c8a791f69791: and I assumed that &lt;!DOCTYPE HTML&gt; is used for html 5. isn't it?
[10:09] 451701585f2d2833921a7b3bd274aafa: Not that way.  HTML 5 uses it, but the rendering engine cannot infer it is HTML 5 from it.
[10:10] 451701585f2d2833921a7b3bd274aafa: HTML 5 does not have a way to name its version.
[10:10] 2da76487dd675c9c57c9c8a791f69791: ok. then maybe I'm wrong here. thx
[10:27] 451701585f2d2833921a7b3bd274aafa: &quot;pixel float&quot; is a state of pixels that float.
[10:27] 451701585f2d2833921a7b3bd274aafa: So &quot;pixelfloat&quot; for video aspect ratio is rather comical.

Now, based only on the above, I would say that the answer is no. The answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer is no because the answer")
