[06:23] 65325d50b2e25aca54bc871b89758c9c: is there any way to see a newer editor's draft so I can check if it is fixed before I report it?
[06:23] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: http://www.w3.org/Style/Group/css2-src/cover.html
[06:23] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: fixes the bug
