[06:24] 65325d50b2e25aca54bc871b89758c9c: http://www.w3.org/Style/Group/css2-src/visufx.html says, about overflow, &quot;It affects the clipping of all of the element's content except any descendant elements (and their respective content and descendants) whose containing block is the viewport or an ancestor of the element.&quot;
