[06:26] 65325d50b2e25aca54bc871b89758c9c: ok, maybe just a lack of clarity, not an error
[06:26] 65325d50b2e25aca54bc871b89758c9c: since if you interpret it that way, it doesn't say anything about how to clip for overflow on the viewport
[06:26] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: that sentence doesn't really say anything about anything
[06:28] 65325d50b2e25aca54bc871b89758c9c: later examples seem to assume it is saying something
