conv_id=677 | raw="
CONVERSATION:
[16:29] 5121e02ff157833791588f8c6a53cae2: hi, i have a windows2000 adv with active directory on it, this is an old box and I want to update the hw - is it just for me to install a new win2003 with active dir and join that into the domain and it will transfere the ad from the old to the new box?
[16:32] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: Lars_, if you install 2k3 on another machine and join it to the domain it will be a member serer.
[16:33] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: Lars_, what you need to do is make the second machine a domain controller too, and then transfer the FSMO roles from the existing domain controller onto it, before demoting the old domain controller and decommissioning it.
[16:33] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: Lars_, but it can be a good deal more complex than that depending upon your environment, you need to read the documentation
[16:35] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: Lars_, <a href="http://support.microsoft.com/kb/812954">http://support.microsoft.com/kb/812954</a>
[16:35] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: I'd suggest you take a look at that
[16:37] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: Or if you're more textually inclined..
[16:37] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: <a href="http://technet2.microsoft.com/WindowsServer/en/Library/8d926ba4-0323-45a6-96f0-db7f7cb33f6b1033.mspx?mfr=true">http://technet2.microsoft.com/WindowsServer/en/Library/8d926ba4-0323-45a6-96f0-db7f7cb33f6b1033.mspx?mfr=true</a>
[16:46] 5121e02ff157833791588f8c6a53cae2: njan, thanks, will it bet easyer to just move the ad from a win2k to the new hw that also run win2k?
[16:46] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: Oh, you're migrating from 2k to 2k?
[16:46] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: Yes, I'd do it that way.
[16:47] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: What else is running on your domain controller?
[16:49] 5121e02ff157833791588f8c6a53cae2: nothing else
[16:49] 5121e02ff157833791588f8c6a53cae2: just need to upgrade the hw
[16:49] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: How many clients/servers do you have?
[16:50] 5121e02ff157833791588f8c6a53cae2: oh, 100
[16:50] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: I'd suggest you do a full upgrade of the domain controller, and then upgrade the domain controller to the new hw
[16:50] be461c3304e7eb09079ff7b419f5f365: I'd suggest you do a full upgrade of the domain controller, and then upgrade the domain controller to the new hw
")
