[12:26] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: hmmm maybe interesting for anne's stats. Group statistics: 383 group participants, over 1700 messages on <email/> this month.
[12:26] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: I see around 150 individuals posters on the list
[12:27] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: but maybe 10 intense contributors
[12:27] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: I should modify my little script to count real contributors
[12:36] f139aba52f9fa1394b4034a7954b2220: f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb, how will you distinguish real contributors from the others?
[12:36] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: s/real/intense/
[12:37] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: a more exact way of counting would be to use the method aaron swartz used for wikipedia. But I haven't enough time for developing such a script
[12:37] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: http://www.aaronsw.com/weblog/whowriteswikipedia
[12:38] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: it is a kind of good example of &quot;Manufacturing Consent&quot;.
[07:53] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: wonders if it would help if Hixie was sending a simple email to the mailing list each time he starts to edit a new item in the editor's draft.
[07:53] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: Even better having a list of the table of content
[07:54] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: and with last edited date beside each entry. and a not yet edited beside things to come.
[07:55] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: then people will /maybe/  be less afraid of things which seem to be dropped when they have not been edited yet.
[07:57] f139aba52f9fa1394b4034a7954b2220: wonders when people will realise that the approach of requiring consensus before editing anything is counterproductive
[07:58] f139aba52f9fa1394b4034a7954b2220: ... and when they will realise that so many issues have been thoroughly discussed in the whatwg prior to merging with the W3C
[08:02] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: f139aba52f9fa1394b4034a7954b2220: it's why I suggest to give information to people beforehand. :)
[08:03] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: it will help people to understand.
[08:03] f139aba52f9fa1394b4034a7954b2220: f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: I think it's a good idea to give people a little bit of information before they start editing something.
[08:04] f47636673b14c54021a69dc06f6a19fb: I think it's a good idea to give people a little bit of information before they")
