[11:57] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: It still gets scaled uglily :-(
[11:58] e3fb62ebfa4f36acf5cbff6a6ed0f2e0: yeah, known
[11:59] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: Is it intentional that width/height are required, or is that a bug?
[12:00] e3fb62ebfa4f36acf5cbff6a6ed0f2e0: bug imo
[12:00] e3fb62ebfa4f36acf5cbff6a6ed0f2e0: see 001.xml :)
[12:02] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: http://philip.html5.org/demos/canvas/svg/scale.html - looks like the &lt;object&gt; itself gets clipped after it's been drawImaged
