[12:10] e3fb62ebfa4f36acf5cbff6a6ed0f2e0: oh, I see
[12:11] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: ctx.drawImage(svg, 0, 0, 100, 100, 0, 0, 100, 100) works, ctx.drawImage(svg, 1, 0, 100, 100, 0, 0, 100, 100) says INDEX_SIZE_ERR
[12:12] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: Oh, it's just throwing if sx+sw &gt; 100
[12:13] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: so you can only select the top 100x100 pixels of the source image
[12:13] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: (for suitable definitions of 'pixel')
[12:13] e3fb62ebfa4f36acf5cbff6a6ed0f2e0: even if the source image is larger?
[12:13] e3fb62ebfa4f36acf5cbff6a6ed0f2e0: for a suitable definition of &quot;larger&quot;
[12:13] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: I think it's a bug, but I'm not sure
[12:13] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f16f668132eaf2: I think it's a bug, but I'm not sure
[12:13] 3f2e2531201cfbf853f1")
