[19:50] ab7faae5d7b250ea8606486575f8f79c: The phrasing of &quot;Named character reference was not terminated by a semicolon. (Or &amp; should have been escaped as &amp;amp;.)&quot; sounds odd, but otherwise I think everything seems possibly reasonable :-)
[19:50] b8810fee2f4a71f849f3f7409546d1d9: ab7faae5d7b250ea8606486575f8f79c: what would you suggest
[19:57] ab7faae5d7b250ea8606486575f8f79c: b8810fee2f4a71f849f3f7409546d1d9: Would it be hard to make it say something like &quot;Character reference did not end with semicolon. (Should have been written as `&amp;copy;` (¬©) or `&amp;amp;copy`)&quot;?
