[09:46] a3f19f90edf0a0893c7847d08016abe3: 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e, regarding changing all instances of DOMObject to any, HTMLCanvasElement::getContext seems like one that should still be an object
[09:46] a3f19f90edf0a0893c7847d08016abe3: i don't see how that could ever usefully return a non-object value
[09:47] a3f19f90edf0a0893c7847d08016abe3: also, i'd suggest just using Object rather than DOMObject... there doesn't seem to be any advantage to using a typedef named DOMObject
[09:49] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: well it's also not ever going to return a Node...
