[06:43] a9b326df4e6da61c5b6f5e1058be83a2: db5363ce314db484defaf0f851894ea3: there's folks awake
[06:43] a9b326df4e6da61c5b6f5e1058be83a2: I think you just scared them away with that bad word you said.
[06:44] db5363ce314db484defaf0f851894ea3: Ha
[06:48] db5363ce314db484defaf0f851894ea3: Well, the whatwg FAQs imply microformats are an acceptable method for effectivly creating your own elements :P
[06:48] db5363ce314db484defaf0f851894ea3: But I was reading in the mailing list archives and I saw a number of people looking at HTML 5 to replace microformats or at least halt &quot;abuses&quot;
