[06:50] db5363ce314db484defaf0f851894ea3: shrugs
[06:50] a9b326df4e6da61c5b6f5e1058be83a2: I can't remember who advocated for replacing microformats
[06:51] a9b326df4e6da61c5b6f5e1058be83a2: db5363ce314db484defaf0f851894ea3: &quot;consensus&quot;
[06:52] a9b326df4e6da61c5b6f5e1058be83a2: the main gripes I've heard about microformats is that they are not spec'ed to the degree necessary for implementors to implement support for them interoperably
