[21:21] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: I think that issue is only in directly editing pages - I think templates may have more capabilities but I'm not an expert on MediaWiki templates (just started creating a few myself for microformats.org/wiki )
[21:22] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: hrm. speaking of templates,
[21:22] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Template:Office_Hours/Documentation
[21:23] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: wrote template code to embed Linden Lab employee office hours as hCalendar so that the technorati hCalendar &gt; iCal service could be used, removing the need to maintain a seperate google calendar
[21:23] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: wow that's cool!
[21:24] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: do you work for Linden Lab?
[21:24] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: nope
[21:24] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: just has a habit of fixing &quot;what they're doing wrong&quot; :-P
[21:25] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: I had a project going for a while that I recently had to retire due to database issues (shared hosting FTL), that was basically a rewrite of all the content on the world.secondlife.com, with microformatted cross-referencing up the wazoo
[21:25] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: it kinda sucks that Google announced rich snippets just after I retired the project :-s
[21:33] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: also gave their xstreetsl.com guy a strong suggestion to switch the markup to hListing etc.
[19:56] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: greetings - just catching up on archives.
[19:57] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403, is your WordPress plugin listed on the hResume implementations section/page? http://microformats.org/wiki/hresume#Implementations
[19:57] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: ntoll - very cool with the hAtom support
[19:58] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: tantek: could you check the output to see if I've marked it up right before I do? http://blog.signpostmarv.name/
[19:58] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: go ahead and add it anyway - no need to wait.
[19:59] fe5fc1e9bf60926e09f6f91b4e6df403: recalls your previous opinion that &quot;virtual worlds weren't deserving of microformats&quot;- does that apply to what this plugin is doing ?
[20:00] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: I think it's a good idea to have a separate page for the hResume implementation, but I'm not sure if it's worth the effort to do so.
[20:00] 3c1a153d81002878b83df957ee534f47: I think it's a good idea to have a separate page for the hResume implementation, but I'm not sure if it's worth the effort to")
