[03:29] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: i'm looking at http://www.whatwg.org/specs/web-apps/current-work/#attr-fe-disabled
[03:29] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: it's not clear to me from that description whether text selection in a disabled input should work
[03:30] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: looking...
[03:31] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: it's up to the UA
[03:31] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: FWIW, IE allows text selection and Gecko/WebKit don't from my quick test
[03:31] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: ok
[03:31] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: thx
[03:32] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: do you want a note in there to that effect?
[03:33] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: meh. i guess text selection stuff is mostly up to the UA, right?
[03:33] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: so a note just in that one instance doesn't seem necessary
[03:33] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: ok
[03:39] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: well this is just silly
[03:39] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: it turns out that sicking's description of what happens with innerHTML and defer scripts and document.write() in IE is slightly wrong
[03:40] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: what's actually going on is that setting innerHTML on a node in the document is causing the pending deferred scripts to be run right there
[03:40] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: and if there are any deferred scripts that haven't loaded yet... they get dropped completely
[03:44] 57551cb51d38c51417f5abfeacfb9b13: ewww
[03:44] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: yeah so obviously we can't spec the dropping on the floor bit
[03:45] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: but it looks like there might be serious compat needs to support the rest of it
[03:51] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: so we can't just drop the whole thing
[03:51] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: but we can just drop the innerHTML bit
[03:51] 69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: so we can just drop the innerHTML bit
[03:51] 69b0d3dfe919a6")
