[09:48] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: There were five global attributes related to microdata including itemid, itemprop, itemref, itemscope and itemtype that i remember seeing, but don't see in the spec right now. Am I missing something?
[09:54] 99d799105c5630cb16b3a7b54e6ae26e: 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: they got split off from the main HTML5 spec about a month (or two) ago.
[09:54] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: thanks
[09:55] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: is it likely to come back in?
[09:56] 99d799105c5630cb16b3a7b54e6ae26e: I guess the WHATWG version of HTML5 still incorporates it.
[09:56] 99d799105c5630cb16b3a7b54e6ae26e: for W3C version, see http://www.w3.org/TR/microdata/ .
[09:57] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: yeah, looking at it
[09:57] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: i think it needs some editing. The attributes are in the body but not in the table of contents
[09:59] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: http://www.w3.org/TR/microdata/#attr-itemref and the like have lost their original stature.
[10:00] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: it states The following attributes are added as global attributes to HTML elements:
[10:00] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: * itemid
[10:00] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: * itemprop
[10:00] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: * itemref
[10:00] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: * itemscope
[10:00] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: * itemtype
[10:00] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: oops, sorry
[10:00] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: but if i recall correctly, those aren't listed in teh global attributes anymore
[10:01] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: the global attributes being here: http://www.w3.org/TR/html5/dom.html#global-attributes
[10:04] 99d799105c5630cb16b3a7b54e6ae26e: because they are two separete specs; Microdata is build on top of HTML5 so those item* attributes cannot be defined in HTML5.
[10:07] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: i think the WHATWG version of HTML5 still incorporates it.
[10:07] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: for W3C version, see http://www.w3.org/TR/microdata/ .
[10:08] 232cfb8f6e3d3fc35eab68ea25c1777d: http://www")
