[10:05] edb259c0e0038f38bb200bc20c8cbf7e: morning
[10:05] 65325d50b2e25aca54bc871b89758c9c: HTML5 has now officially been proposed to the HTML WG
[10:08] edb259c0e0038f38bb200bc20c8cbf7e: I saw, cool
[10:08] edb259c0e0038f38bb200bc20c8cbf7e: and now we wait
