[17:17] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74, what would you suggest about the license element in hrecipe? should we remove it? i think it's really not an important part of the format and i can see no solution to the problem anytime soon
[17:20] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: or we add a remark taht it can only be used to add a license to all recipes on a page
[17:21] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: it is difficult. there is a large base of rel-license software out there (Yahoo license search, etc) which is likely to never understand hRecipe, hAudio, etc.
[17:22] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: so any time they see rel=license, they will assume it applies to the whole page
[17:23] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: well, if we add a hint to the format taht you MUST use the element at most ONCE on a apage, tahn its clear to yahoo et al
[17:23] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: sorry about the typos
[17:24] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: would be better than leaving it out alltogether, wouldn't it?
[17:34] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74? see above... ;-)
[17:56] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: if it's only to be used once in a page though, there is no need to include it in hRecipe. The rel-license simply applies to the page and everything on it (including recipes).
[17:57] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: good point. so i'll move it to closed issues and remove it from the proposal
[18:00] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: do you think it can be made a draft. i would do so, but i'm not sure if that's already okay or premature
[18:05] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: I think that probably the draft format should be moved onto a separate page from the brainstorming (e.g. /wiki/hrecipe) so that we can concentrate on polishing it up
[18:10] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: of course. so principally you too think it's okay to take that step?
[18:12] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: well, i take taht as a no-brainer. i think it's a good idea to move it to a separate page from the brainstorming
[18:13] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: i think it's a good idea to move it to a separate page from the brainstorming
[18:14] b5d30d87d3e4dab71d8ff14065384894: i think it's a good idea")
