conv_id=1528 | raw="
CONVERSATION:
[08:58] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: i have a problem when ever lately i log off my laptop i get a error that i can not save my profile....this was working a while ago. what can be going on. i have not changed anything...plus my other computers have not experience this error.
[09:00] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: at the risk of sounding like a broken record: increase log verbosity on samba and restart it. recreate the problem, see what shows up in the logs.
[09:01] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: i assume this is a samba DC?
[09:01] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: yes
[09:01] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: i will look at that.
[09:02] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: what is so annoying is that it was working a couple of weeks ago and then out of the blue it started doing this error
[09:02] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: the problem may be something as simple as your laptop trying to dump its profile into an invalid share
[09:02] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: ??
[09:02] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: i.e. a non-existent share. at any rate, logging will tell you what's happening
[09:04] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: hopefully i can get the profile....the last couple of times i couldnt get the profile to load
[09:06] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: sounds like either you're attempting to use a share that doesn't exist or your connection is being rejected or permissions. or something. :)
[09:07] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: it is not permissions because to see if it was that i change the directory to 777
[09:09] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: if you want to find out really quick what's happening, in the global section of smb.conf, add 'log level = 4', then smbcontrol smbd reload-config &amp;&amp; smbcontrol nmbd reload-config and recreate the problem
[09:09] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: log level = 4 should be about right. if it doesn't give you the info you need, crank it up to 10.
[09:10] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: that is what i was doing...i set it at 5 would that be ok
[09:11] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: yeah, should be.
[09:12] 90516640a1009f6509db7aeb15b4b33c: well be back in a few going to log off and see what is going to happen....see in a few
[09:12] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: i will try to log off and see what happens
[09:13] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: i will try to log off and see what happens
[09:13] dac4708bddf69a1773f2e3e4502d0f09: i will try to log off and see what happens
