[05:10] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: why there are both document.getSelection() and window.getSelection()?
[05:10] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: what's the difference between them?
[05:10] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: afaik window can't have more than one document (unless iframes are used)
[05:22] 0de37da1d654c10aed33d7b7347b8e3b: document.getSelection is mostly a 'handy alias' for window.getSelection
[05:23] 0de37da1d654c10aed33d7b7347b8e3b: https://developer.mozilla.org/en/DOM/document.getSelection
[05:26] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: 0de37da1d654c10aed33d7b7347b8e3b: ok, thanks
[05:26] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: but I must admit that it's confusing
[05:27] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: it would make sense for DOM methods to be placed in document object
[05:28] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: no, wait... window object has DOMWindow in prototype chain
[05:28] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: nvm
[18:22] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: is there a way to stop execution of all scripts inside iframe?
[18:22] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: and resume them later?
[18:26] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: there is https://developer.mozilla.org/en/DOM/Using_the_Page_Visibility_API
[18:26] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: but I want to be 100% sure that there is no script running
[18:44] 0de37da1d654c10aed33d7b7347b8e3b: pretty sure that violates the &quot;the user calls the shot&quot; concept
[18:44] 0de37da1d654c10aed33d7b7347b8e3b: you could try to make it work without resorting to iframe
[18:45] 0de37da1d654c10aed33d7b7347b8e3b: alternatively, ajax-get the content for the iframe, strip all scripts, then load THAT into the iframe instead
[19:04] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: I would like to stop the scripts inside iframe just for a while
[19:04] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: so that it does not block the ui in parent node
[19:05] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: reloading the iframe with scripts stripped would require too much overhead
[19:10] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: so I would like to stop the scripts inside iframe just for a while
[19:10] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: so that it does not block the ui in parent node
[19:10] c63a5cfce0a1819ebbe4a19e074356b6: reloading the iframe with scripts stripped would")
