[01:12] 70bfd0ae2cfbf2da192bddd569cf6132: Well, I guess I'll just go by http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VCard#Properties
[01:17] c74f596e4fe95fc3bb8726dbde2031b0: The microformat spec pages usually list all of them.  Otherwise, the original spec (as you said, vCard in the case of hCard) is a good place to look
