[10:04] b8810fee2f4a71f849f3f7409546d1d9: b25b6b77a0087ff8385941e5545d32ea: yeah
[21:11] b8810fee2f4a71f849f3f7409546d1d9: b25b6b77a0087ff8385941e5545d32ea: hmm. testing suggests that real world requires what the spec says--not what html5lib does (Re: afe)
