[18:09] c53ce266132145423a95034f111ad7dd: what‚Äôs the best way to force reload a single cached (HTML) file when you‚Äôre using appcache/manifest?
[18:11] c53ce266132145423a95034f111ad7dd: you could tweak the manifest file but then it would check *all* files for changes first
[18:12] c53ce266132145423a95034f111ad7dd: is there a way to explicitly say ‚Äúreload JUST THIS FILE‚Äù or smth?
