[18:17] b9c1821167fa1bd75a48c1a6d667a6be: c53ce266132145423a95034f111ad7dd, Seems like the only way is to modify the manifest file. Search for the second occurrence of the word refresh on this page: http://www.html5rocks.com/en/tutorials/appcache/beginner/
