[09:55] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: Can anyone tell me why the 'tel' on this page doesn't value exerpt the way I expect? http://ciaranmcnulty.com/contact
[10:00] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: it does! http://srv.buzzword.org.uk/n3/ciaranmcnulty.com/contact
[10:01] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: What parser is behaving incorrectly?
[10:01] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74 - hm, YQL
[10:02] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: actually Operator seems to be doing it correctly
[10:02] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: I guess I need to report it to Yahoo!
[10:03] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: Possibly Yahoo don't do value excerption, or don't do it properly.
[10:04] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: &lt;meta data_quality=&quot;0&quot; property=&quot;vcard:tel&quot;&gt;Home +44 (0) 7092 305237&lt;/meta&gt;
[10:04] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: Maybe they might have better luck with the &lt;abbr&gt; pattern.
[10:04] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: shame, though
[10:05] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: MnNulty - that is RDFa, which they do support, but there would probably be problems trying to mix and match RDFa and microformats.
[10:05] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: trying to minimise my use of ABBR where possible
[10:05] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: no sorry, that's in the YQL result
[10:05] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: they return the results in an RDFa type format
[10:05] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: even if the source is from uF
[10:07] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: Ah.
[10:07] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: Their dataRSS thingy.
[10:07] 5832a673ae3016d62e5f4af031067e74: Which is (confusingly) Atom-based IIRC.
[10:08] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: I think it's a bit of a hacky way of doing it, but it's the only way I've found to get the results I want.
[10:08] 9a04a81b9bdcc11c970688d01bb361be: I think it's a bit of a hacky way of doing it, but it's the only way I've found to get the results I want.
