[20:25] 738a5342e244e25b38d2cfc24bacc6fc: yeah I like that idea, saves a lot of effort that would otherwise go into paying designers!
[20:25] 9f873a67efcfe48cac10405dc48d2263: Yup, heck, you can use JavaScript to listen for when the animation finishes, and as soon as it does, remove it from the DOM
