[05:02] 8bbf421c7f4d9378975a401867ca6340: according to the book I'm reading, it was for forms
[05:02] 8bbf421c7f4d9378975a401867ca6340: so you could say: &lt;form action=&quot;...&quot; template=&quot;something/{variable}&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; name=&quot;variable&quot; /&gt;&lt;/form&gt;
