[01:35] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: is now using two-factor auth for Google, yay
[01:35] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: Now I just have to make sure no one steals my phone.
[01:35] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: (not that I'll lose access, but they'll have access to my Google account)
[01:35] 06cb330920ae58e1614c9145d983b3d6: i'd be much more concerned about someone stealing my phone than any possible attacks on my password, heh
[01:35] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: (and could hypothetically revoke my access)
[01:35] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: (but that's still strictly better than not having two-factor auth)
[01:35] 06cb330920ae58e1614c9145d983b3d6: sounds like a solution worse than the problem
[01:36] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: No, because they could already do that anyway.
[01:36] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: Except they could do even worse without the two-factor auth.
[01:36] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: At least now it's a special revocable password that they'll get instead of my main password.
[01:37] 06cb330920ae58e1614c9145d983b3d6: ... do android phones store the google password in the clear? heh
[01:37] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: How else would they log you in?
[01:37] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: It's like any browser where you save the password.
[01:37] 06cb330920ae58e1614c9145d983b3d6: a password hashed with a device ID, etc
[01:37] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: It seems like that would make no difference in practice, if you can use it to log in.
[01:38] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: Except that you can't easily guess the user's password on other sites, if they use the same password.
[01:38] 06cb330920ae58e1614c9145d983b3d6: of course it does; you can't change the user's password with it, or authenticate to things that a phone doesn't implicitly auth to
[01:38] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: Well, if that were the case, yes.
[01:38] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: Maybe for the main Android password thing that is in fact how it works.  I dunno.
[01:39] 06cb330920ae58e1614c9145d983b3d6: I don't think it's that easy to guess the user's password on other sites, if they use the same password.
[01:39] 88d4d34a8064a4ff39fd5e144eea7762: I don't think it's that easy to guess the user's password on other sites, if they use the same password.
[01:39] 88d4d34a8064a4ff3")
