[18:41] 587bf8b858e15d03428e1415c33c38ef: http://tantek.pbworks.com/w/page/19402944/MyNextStartup says &quot;Everyone in the company must be at least a little experienced with IRC and should use the company internal IRC channels ...&quot; but doesn't say why.
[18:42] 587bf8b858e15d03428e1415c33c38ef: I'm setting up a new dev group; we're co-located, so the motivation to use IM/chat is less; the head of the group isn't in the habit, but the new guy we just hired is, and I'm trying to use that to advance the cause.
[18:43] 587bf8b858e15d03428e1415c33c38ef: the head of the group picked up the wiki way quite quickly.
